Subject: [PATCH 136/138] umdns: update to Git HEAD (2026-10-04)

33a031c818ad dns: bound dns_query() AVL walk with avl_is_last()
15a507e099ff cache: terminate cached TXT record inside its allocation
7ff4347014bd dns: check record allocation in dns_packet_answer()
7aa74cc1239f dns,interface: guard against NULL ifa_addr and getifaddrs() failure
4d3628f8634e ubus: bound TXT copy in umdns_announcements()
93b2903c92f8 service: initialise SRV priority and weight
5dc24e8c80d9 dns: handle missing unicast interface in parse_question()
ba53b7c932e8 service: validate txt entries and stop leaking on empty ones
e115784cb334 dns: reset packet after each batch in dns_query_pending()
126426e66e19 interface: compare full IPv6 address in source check
e035293d1d2b dns: include stdbool.h in dns.h
5b9638a13631 tests: stub the udebug helpers
defe7ccfd202 tests: add fuzz corpus entry for the dns_query() AVL walk

